# YogShakti — environment variables
#
# HOW TO USE
#   1. Copy this file:  cp .env.example .env
#   2. Fill in real values in .env
#   3. Never commit .env — it is already listed in .gitignore
#
# Phase 1 needs NO environment variables. The app runs with none of these set.
# They are listed here so the shape of the file is ready for later phases.

# ---- Phase 2: PostgreSQL + Prisma ----
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@localhost:5432/yogshakti?schema=public"

# ---- Later phases ----
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"
